Modifications
-------------
1. Removed the commercially-licensed enterprise directories, which are NOT
   covered by the AGPL and require a Dub Enterprise subscription to run in
   production:
     - apps/web/app/(ee)
     - apps/web/app/app.dub.co/(dashboard)/[slug]/(ee)
   Their licence terms are in apps/web/app/(ee)/LICENSE.md upstream.

2. Removed dashboard pages and integration routes left dangling by (1), where
   AffGo has no use for the feature (partner payouts, domain registration,
   identity verification, bounties).

3. Added a click-forwarding job that drains the workspace click-event stream
   and delivers each click to AffGo. Written independently against the AGPL
   producer side; it is not derived from the removed enterprise code.

